<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="description" content="FileMakr — final-year project reports, source code, live demos, and documentation for B.Tech, M.Tech, BCA, MCA, and more. IEEE-ready PDFs, diagrams, and working code.">
  <title>FileMakr — Final Year Project Reports &amp; Source Code</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #0e1220;
      --muted: #5c6370;
      --bg: #f4f6fb;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --brand: #2a47ff;
      --brand-dark: #1e36d6;
      --accent: #f17f23;
      --ring: rgba(42, 71, 255, 0.22);
      --shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(14, 18, 32, 0.08);
      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 12px rgba(14, 18, 32, 0.06);
      --radius: 16px;
      --nav-h: 64px;
      --safe-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "IBM Plex Sans", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.55;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    a { color: var(--brand); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    a:hover { color: var(--brand-dark); }

    .skip-link {
      position: absolute;
      left: -9999px;
      top: 0;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: var(--brand);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      z-index: 10000;
    }
    .skip-link:focus { left: 12px; top: 12px; outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }

    /* Header */
    .site-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(14, 18, 32, 0.06);
    }
    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 12px max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left)) 12px max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      min-height: var(--nav-h);
    }
    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .logo-mark {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--accent));
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(42, 71, 255, 0.35);
    }
    .nav-desktop {
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    @media (min-width: 880px) {
      .nav-desktop { display: flex; }
      .nav-toggle { display: none; }
    }
    .nav-desktop a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
    }
    .nav-desktop a:hover {
      background: rgba(42, 71, 255, 0.08);
      color: var(--brand);
    }
    .nav-cta {
      background: var(--brand) !important;
      color: #fff !important;
      margin-left: 4px;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover {
      background: var(--brand-dark) !important;
      color: #fff !important;
    }

    .nav-toggle {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(14, 18, 32, 0.1);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #fff;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 5px;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .nav-toggle span {
      display: block;
      width: 20px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--ink);
      border-radius: 1px;
      transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg); }
    .nav-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
    .nav-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg); }

    .nav-mobile {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
      padding: 8px 16px 16px;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(14, 18, 32, 0.06);
      background: #fff;
    }
    .nav-mobile[hidden] { display: none !important; }
    .nav-mobile a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 14px 12px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .nav-mobile a:hover, .nav-mobile a:focus-visible { background: rgba(42, 71, 255, 0.06); outline: none; }
    .nav-mobile .nav-cta { text-align: center; margin-top: 6px; }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left)) clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5rem) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 20% 20%, rgba(42, 71, 255, 0.14), transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 85% 30%, rgba(241, 127, 35, 0.12), transparent 50%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #eef1f8 0%, var(--bg) 100%);
      z-index: -1;
    }
    .hero-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
      align-items: center;
    }
    @media (min-width: 900px) {
      .hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; }
    }

    .hero-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--brand);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .hero-kicker::before {
      content: "";
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(241, 127, 35, 0.25);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4.5vw, 2.65rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .hero-lead {
      margin: 0 0 24px;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem);
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 36em;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 0 22px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s, background 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--brand);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(42, 71, 255, 0.35);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--brand-dark); color: #fff; transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn-secondary {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--ink);
      border: 1px solid rgba(14, 18, 32, 0.12);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--brand); color: var(--brand); }

    .hero-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      max-width: 420px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 400px) {
      .hero-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .stat {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
      border: 1px solid rgba(14, 18, 32, 0.06);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .stat strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .stat span { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }

    .hero-panel {
      background: var(--card);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 1px solid rgba(14, 18, 32, 0.07);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: clamp(20px, 4vw, 28px);
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero-panel::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: -1px;
      border-radius: inherit;
      padding: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(42, 71, 255, 0.2), rgba(241, 127, 35, 0.15));
      -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
      mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
      -webkit-mask-composite: xor;
      mask-composite: exclude;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .panel-title {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0 0 16px;
    }
    .check-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
    .check-list li {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .check-list li::before {
      content: "✓";
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(42, 71, 255, 0.1);
      color: var(--brand);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    /* Sections */
    .section {
      padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left)) clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
    }
    .section-alt { background: #fff; }
    .section-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .section-head {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
    }
    .section-head h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .section-head p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; }

    .card-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 20px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) { .card-grid.cols-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
    @media (min-width: 1000px) { .card-grid.cols-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }

    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(14, 18, 32, 0.07);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      height: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border-color: rgba(42, 71, 255, 0.2);
    }
    .card-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--accent);
      background: rgba(241, 127, 35, 0.1);
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      align-self: flex-start;
    }
    .card h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .card p { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9375rem; flex-grow: 1; }
    .card-link {
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--brand);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: auto;
    }
    .card-link:hover { gap: 10px; }

    .tech-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 20px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    @media (min-width: 700px) { .tech-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }

    .tech-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 1px solid rgba(14, 18, 32, 0.07);
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .tech-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .tech-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }
    .tech-dot.php { background: #777bb4; }
    .tech-dot.node { background: #68a063; }
    .tech-dot.py { background: #3776ab; }
    .tech-card ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.15rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .tech-card li { margin-bottom: 8px; }

    .cta-band {
      background: linear-gradient(105deg, var(--brand) 0%, #4a2fa8 45%, var(--accent) 100%);
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left)) clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
    }
    .cta-band h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.75rem); font-weight: 800; }
    .cta-band p { margin: 0 0 22px; opacity: 0.92; max-width: 520px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .cta-band .btn-primary {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--brand);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    }
    .cta-band .btn-primary:hover { background: #f0f2ff; color: var(--brand-dark); }

    /* Footer */
    .site-footer {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      padding: 48px max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left)) calc(28px + var(--safe-bottom)) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }
    .footer-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 32px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    @media (min-width: 700px) {
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.4fr repeat(3, 1fr); }
    }
    .footer-brand { font-weight: 800; color: #fff; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .footer-col h4 { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45); }
    .footer-col ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .footer-col li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .footer-col a { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
    .footer-col a:hover { color: #fff; text-decoration: underline; }
    .footer-bottom {
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      text-align: center;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a class="logo" href="/" aria-label="FileMakr home">
        <span class="logo-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        FileMakr
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-desktop" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="/demo">Live demos</a>
        <a href="/source-code">Source code</a>
        <a href="/final-year-project-ideas">Project ideas</a>
        <a href="/btech-final-year-project-report">Reports</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="/source-code">Browse projects</a>
      </nav>
      <button type="button" class="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-nav" aria-label="Open menu">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div id="mobile-nav" class="nav-mobile" hidden>
      <a href="/demo">Live demos</a>
      <a href="/source-code">Source code</a>
      <a href="/final-year-project-ideas">Project ideas</a>
      <a href="/btech-final-year-project-report">Project reports</a>
      <a class="nav-cta btn btn-primary" href="/source-code">Browse projects</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div>
          <p class="hero-kicker">Reports · Code · Demos</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">Everything you need for a standout final-year project</h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">IEEE-style documentation, working source code, and browser-ready demos — built for B.Tech, M.Tech, BCA, MCA, and university-specific formats. Ship a submission-ready project without starting from zero.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/source-code">Explore source code</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/demo">View live demos</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-stats" role="list">
            <div class="stat" role="listitem"><strong>IEEE</strong><span>Report structure</span></div>
            <div class="stat" role="listitem"><strong>Stack-ready</strong><span>PHP, MERN, Python</span></div>
            <div class="stat" role="listitem"><strong>Fast</strong><span>WhatsApp support</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-panel" aria-label="What you get">
          <p class="panel-title">What students use FileMakr for</p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>Turnitin-conscious reports with chapters, diagrams, and test cases</li>
            <li>Source code with database scripts and README you can defend in viva</li>
            <li>Live demos to preview behaviour before you commit to a topic</li>
            <li>Custom formatting when your college template is non-standard</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="demo" class="section section-alt" aria-labelledby="demo-title">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 id="demo-title">Live demo projects</h2>
          <p>Try real applications in the browser — same stacks we ship in source packages.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-grid cols-3">
          <article class="card">
            <span class="card-tag">PHP · MySQL</span>
            <h3>Online food ordering</h3>
            <p>Full ordering flow with catalog, cart, and admin-friendly structure — ideal for hospitality and e-commerce topics.</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="/demo">Open demo hub <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <span class="card-tag">MERN</span>
            <h3>Student attendance</h3>
            <p>Modern SPA patterns with API-backed records — strong fit for attendance, LMS, and campus portals.</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="/demo">Open demo hub <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <span class="card-tag">Java · Spring</span>
            <h3>Hospital management</h3>
            <p>Enterprise-style modules for patients, staff, and scheduling — demonstrates layered architecture clearly.</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="/demo">Open demo hub <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="tech" class="section" aria-labelledby="tech-title">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 id="tech-title">Projects by technology</h2>
          <p>Pick your stack — we keep listings organised so you spend less time searching.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-grid">
          <div class="tech-card">
            <h3><span class="tech-dot php" aria-hidden="true"></span> PHP &amp; MySQL</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>News portals &amp; CMS-style builds</li>
              <li>Booking &amp; reservation systems</li>
              <li>Job boards &amp; classifieds</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-card">
            <h3><span class="tech-dot node" aria-hidden="true"></span> Node.js &amp; MERN</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Task &amp; ticket management</li>
              <li>Realtime chat &amp; collaboration</li>
              <li>Analytics &amp; dashboards</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-card">
            <h3><span class="tech-dot py" aria-hidden="true"></span> Python</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>ML &amp; classification projects</li>
              <li>Computer vision &amp; attendance</li>
              <li>Data tools &amp; APIs</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="text-align:center;margin:32px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;">
          <a href="/source-code">Browse all categories on the source-code page →</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="reports" class="section section-alt" aria-labelledby="reports-title">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 id="reports-title">Project reports &amp; documentation</h2>
          <p>Documentation that matches how evaluators actually read: clear structure, figures, and reproducible results.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-grid cols-3">
          <article class="card">
            <span class="card-tag">Engineering</span>
            <h3>B.Tech / M.Tech reports</h3>
            <p>Chapter flow, literature survey, system design, and testing — aligned with common IEEE and university rubrics.</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="/btech-final-year-project-report">View B.Tech reports <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <span class="card-tag">Computer apps</span>
            <h3>BCA / MCA reports</h3>
            <p>Readable explanations, DFD/ER coverage, and UI walkthroughs that match practical viva questions.</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="/bca-final-year-project-report">View BCA reports <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </article>
